<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Legal Intake Form</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            color: #334155;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            padding: 2rem;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 0.75rem; /* rounded-xl */
            box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); /* shadow-lg */
        }
        h1, h2 {
            color: #1e293b;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 2.25rem; /* text-4xl */
            text-align: center;
        }
        h2 {
            font-size: 1.875rem; /* text-3xl */
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 2.5rem;
        }
        label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #475569;
        }
        input[type="text"],
        input[type="email"],
        input[type="tel"],
        input[type="date"],
        textarea,
        select {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            border-radius: 0.5rem; /* rounded-lg */
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #334155;
            transition: border-color 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }
        input[type="text"]:focus,
        input[type="email"]:focus,
        input[type="tel"]:focus,
        input[type="date"]:focus,
        textarea:focus,
        select:focus {
            outline: none;
            border-color: #3b82f6; /* blue-500 */
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2); /* ring-2 ring-blue-500/20 */
        }
        textarea {
            min-height: 100px;
            resize: vertical;
        }
        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .radio-group label, .checkbox-group label {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-right: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .radio-group input[type="radio"], .checkbox-group input[type="checkbox"] {
            margin-right: 0.5rem;
            width: auto;
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }
        button {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 1rem;
            background-color: #2563eb; /* blue-700 */
            color: #ffffff;
            font-weight: 600;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 0.5rem; /* rounded-lg */
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.125rem; /* text-lg */
            transition: background-color 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
        }
        button:hover {
            background-color: #1d4ed8; /* blue-800 */
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .language-switcher {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .language-switcher select {
            width: auto;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-left: 0.5rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            border-radius: 0.5rem;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .text-section {
            background-color: #f1f5f9; /* slate-100 */
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 0.75rem; /* rounded-xl */
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        }
        .text-section p {
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }
        .text-section ul {
            list-style-type: disc;
            margin-left: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="language-switcher">
            <label for="language-select" class="text-lg font-semibold">Select Language:</label>
            <select id="language-select" onchange="changeLanguage()">
                <option value="en">English</option>
                <option value="es">Español</option>
                <option value="zh">中文 (Mandarin)</option>
                <option value="ko">한국어 (Korean)</option>
                <option value="ja">日本語 (Japanese)</option>
                <option value="ar">العربية (Arabic)</option>
            </select>
        </div>

        <form id="intakeForm">
            <h1 data-lang-key="formTitle">Legal Intake Form</h1>

            <section id="personalInfo">
                <h2 data-lang-key="personalInfoTitle">Personal Information</h2>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="fullName" data-lang-key="fullNameLabel">Full Name:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="fullName" name="fullName" required class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="dob" data-lang-key="dobLabel">Date of Birth:</label>
                    <input type="date" id="dob" name="dob" required class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="address" data-lang-key="addressLabel">Address:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="address" name="address" required class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="phone" data-lang-key="phoneLabel">Phone Number:</label>
                    <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" required class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="email" data-lang-key="emailLabel">Email Address:</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="occupation" data-lang-key="occupationLabel">Occupation:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="occupation" name="occupation" class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="debtInfo">
                <h2 data-lang-key="debtInfoTitle">Debt Information</h2>
                <div class="form-group radio-group">
                    <label data-lang-key="oweDebtQuestion">Do you owe debt?</label>
                    <div>
                        <label><input type="radio" name="oweDebt" value="yes" class="rounded-md"> <span data-lang-key="yes">Yes</span></label>
                        <label><input type="radio" name="oweDebt" value="no" class="rounded-md"> <span data-lang-key="no">No</span></label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group radio-group">
                    <label data-lang-key="actionAgainstYouQuestion">Is there any legal action against you (e.g., lawsuit, garnishment)?</label>
                    <div>
                        <label><input type="radio" name="actionAgainstYou" value="yes" class="rounded-md"> <span data-lang-key="yes">Yes</span></label>
                        <label><input type="radio" name="actionAgainstYou" value="no" class="rounded-md"> <span data-lang-key="no">No</span></label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group radio-group">
                    <label data-lang-key="judgmentEnteredQuestion">Has a judgment been entered against you?</label>
                    <div>
                        <label><input type="radio" name="judgmentEntered" value="yes" class="rounded-md"> <span data-lang-key="yes">Yes</span></label>
                        <label><input type="radio" name="judgmentEntered" value="no" class="rounded-md"> <span data-lang-key="no">No</span></label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group radio-group">
                    <label data-lang-key="debtCollectionNoticeQuestion">Do you have a debt collection notice?</label>
                    <div>
                        <label><input type="radio" name="debtCollectionNotice" value="yes" class="rounded-md"> <span data-lang-key="yes">Yes</span></label>
                        <label><input type="radio" name="debtCollectionNotice" value="no" class="rounded-md"> <span data-lang-key="no">No</span></label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group radio-group">
                    <label data-lang-key="paymentPlanQuestion">Are you able to enter into a payment plan?</label>
                    <div>
                        <label><input type="radio" name="paymentPlan" value="yes" class="rounded-md"> <span data-lang-key="yes">Yes</span></label>
                        <label><input type="radio" name="paymentPlan" value="no" class="rounded-md"> <span data-lang-key="no">No</span></label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="paymentPlanAmount" data-lang-key="paymentPlanAmountLabel">If yes, how much per month?</label>
                    <input type="text" id="paymentPlanAmount" name="paymentPlanAmount" placeholder="$" class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="otherDebt" data-lang-key="otherDebtLabel">Do you owe other debt? Please describe:</label>
                    <textarea id="otherDebt" name="otherDebt" class="rounded-lg"></textarea>
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="retainerAgreement">
                <h2 data-lang-key="retainerAgreementTitle">Retainer Agreement (Consumer Example)</h2>
                <div class="text-section">
                    <p id="retainerIntro" data-lang-key="retainerIntro">This Retainer Agreement ("Agreement") is made between [Law Firm Name] ("Attorney") and <span id="clientNamePlaceholder" class="font-bold">[Client Full Name]</span> ("Client") on this <span id="currentDatePlaceholder" class="font-bold"></span>.</p>
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2" data-lang-key="scopeOfServicesTitle">1. Scope of Services:</h3>
                    <p data-lang-key="scopeOfServicesContent">Attorney agrees to provide legal services to Client concerning the matter of debt resolution and related legal actions. This may include, but is not limited to, reviewing debt collection notices, negotiating with creditors, and representing Client in court if necessary. This agreement does not cover bankruptcy proceedings unless specifically agreed upon in writing.</p>
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2" data-lang-key="attorneyFeesTitle">2. Attorney Fees:</h3>
                    <p data-lang-key="attorneyFeesContent1">Client agrees to pay Attorney a non-refundable retainer fee of <span class="font-bold" data-lang-key="retainerFeeAmount"></span> upon signing this Agreement. This retainer will be applied against hourly fees for services rendered at the rate of <span class="font-bold" data-lang-key="hourlyRate"></span> per hour for attorney time and <span class="font-bold" data-lang-key="paralegalRate"></span> per hour for paralegal time.</p>
                    <p data-lang-key="attorneyFeesContent2">Client will be billed monthly for services rendered and costs incurred. Payments are due upon receipt of the invoice. Interest may be charged on overdue balances at the rate of <span class="font-bold" data-lang-key="interestRate"></span> per annum.</p>
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2" data-lang-key="costsAndExpensesTitle">3. Costs and Expenses:</h3>
                    <p data-lang-key="costsAndExpensesContent">Client is responsible for all costs and expenses incurred in connection with this matter, including but not limited to filing fees, court costs, deposition costs, expert witness fees, and travel expenses. Attorney will seek Client's approval for any significant expenses before incurring them.</p>
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2" data-lang-key="terminationTitle">4. Termination:</h3>
                    <p data-lang-key="terminationContent">Either party may terminate this Agreement at any time by providing written notice. Upon termination, Client will be responsible for all fees and costs incurred up to the date of termination. Any unearned portion of the retainer will be refunded to Client.</p>
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2" data-lang-key="disclaimerTitle">5. Disclaimer:</h3>
                    <p data-lang-key="disclaimerContent">Attorney makes no guarantees regarding the outcome of this matter. All statements made by Attorney are opinions only.</p>
                    <p data-lang-key="agreementAcknowledgement">By signing below, Client acknowledges that they have read, understood, and agreed to the terms of this Retainer Agreement.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="retainerSignature" data-lang-key="clientSignatureLabel">Client Signature:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="retainerSignature" name="retainerSignature" required class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="retainerDate" data-lang-key="dateLabel">Date:</label>
                    <input type="date" id="retainerDate" name="retainerDate" required class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="creditReportAuth">
                <h2 data-lang-key="creditReportAuthTitle">Authorization to Request Credit Report</h2>
                <div class="text-section">
                    <p id="creditReportAuthIntro" data-lang-key="creditReportAuthIntro">I, <span id="authClientNamePlaceholder" class="font-bold">[Client Full Name]</span>, hereby authorize [Law Firm Name] to obtain a copy of my credit report from one or more consumer reporting agencies for the purpose of assessing my financial situation related to debt resolution.</p>
                    <p data-lang-key="creditReportAuthPurpose">I understand that this authorization is for the sole purpose of providing legal services to me and will not be used for any other purpose.</p>
                    <p data-lang-key="creditReportAuthRelease">I release [Law Firm Name] and any consumer reporting agency from any liability for obtaining or providing such information.</p>
                    <p data-lang-key="creditReportAuthConsent">This authorization shall remain in effect for the duration of my representation by [Law Firm Name] or until revoked by me in writing.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="creditAuthSignature" data-lang-key="clientSignatureLabel">Client Signature:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="creditAuthSignature" name="creditAuthSignature" required class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="creditAuthDate" data-lang-key="dateLabel">Date:</label>
                    <input type="date" id="creditAuthDate" name="creditAuthDate" required class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
            </section>

            <section id="socialMediaWaiver">
                <h2 data-lang-key="socialMediaWaiverTitle">Social Media Waiver and Authorization Form</h2>
                <div class="text-section">
                    <p id="socialMediaWaiverIntro" data-lang-key="socialMediaWaiverIntro">I, <span id="socialClientNamePlaceholder" class="font-bold">[Client Full Name]</span>, understand that social media (e.g., Facebook, X (formerly Twitter), Instagram, LinkedIn, etc.) can be a source of information that may be relevant to my legal matter.</p>
                    <p data-lang-key="socialMediaWaiverWarning">I acknowledge that any information I post or that is posted about me on social media platforms, including photos, videos, and comments, may be discoverable and used as evidence in my legal case.</p>
                    <p data-lang-key="socialMediaWaiverRecommendation">I understand that it is strongly recommended that I refrain from posting any information about my case, my financial situation, or my activities on social media while my case is pending. I also understand that I should review my privacy settings on all social media accounts to ensure maximum privacy.</p>
                    <p data-lang-key="socialMediaWaiverAuthorization">I authorize [Law Firm Name] to review my publicly available social media profiles and content if deemed necessary for my legal representation. I understand that [Law Firm Name] will not attempt to gain unauthorized access to my private social media accounts.</p>
                    <p data-lang-key="socialMediaWaiverRelease">I release [Law Firm Name] from any liability for any adverse consequences that may arise from information found on my social media profiles.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="socialMediaSignature" data-lang-key="clientSignatureLabel">Client Signature:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="socialMediaSignature" name="socialMediaSignature" required class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="socialMediaDate" data-lang-key="dateLabel">Date:</label>
                    <input type="date" id="socialMediaDate" name="socialMediaDate" required class="rounded-lg">
                </div>
            </section>

            <button type="submit" class="rounded-lg" data-lang-key="submitButton">Submit Form</button>
        </form>
    </div>

